Documentation verification complete for Feature Name.

Component documentation:
- All components have complete JSDoc comments
- All component props are documented
- All component directories have README files
- All components have usage examples

Hook documentation:
- All hooks have complete JSDoc comments
- All hook parameters and return types are documented
- All hooks have usage examples in documentation
- Hooks directory has comprehensive README

State management documentation:
- Slice definitions, actions, and selectors are documented
- Redux store has complete README documentation
- Usage examples provided for all store functionality
- Type definitions are complete and documented

API documentation:
- API methods fully documented with parameters and return types
- API error handling documented
- API types comprehensively documented
- API README provides usage guidance

README documentation:
